### 120-Realtime-TaskBoard API - http://localhost:5155
### Requires PostgreSQL running on localhost:5432

### ===== BOARDS =====

### Get all boards
GET http://localhost:5155/api/boards
Accept: application/json

### Create a board
POST http://localhost:5155/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sprint 42",
  "description": "Q3 Sprint Planning Board"
}

### Get board detail (with columns and tasks)
GET http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update board
PUT http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sprint 42 - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete board
DELETE http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}

### ===== COLUMNS =====

### Get columns for a board
GET http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Accept: application/json

### Add column to board
POST http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "QA Testing",
  "color": "#a855f7"
}

### Update column
PUT http://localhost:5155/api/columns/{{columnId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "QA Testing (Renamed)",
  "color": "#7c3aed"
}

### Reorder columns
PUT http://localhost:5155/api/columns/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "columnIds": ["{{col1}}", "{{col2}}", "{{col3}}", "{{col4}}"]
}

### Delete column
DELETE http://localhost:5155/api/columns/{{columnId}}

### ===== TASKS =====

### Get tasks in a column
GET http://localhost:5155/api/columns/{{columnId}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Create task
POST http://localhost:5155/api/columns/{{columnId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement SignalR real-time sync",
  "description": "Add WebSocket-based real-time updates for task board",
  "priority": "High",
  "assignee": "dev@example.com",
  "labels": ["feature", "backend"],
  "dueDate": "2026-10-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:5155/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement SignalR real-time sync (Done!)",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### Move task to another column
PUT http://localhost:5155/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetColumnId": "{{targetColumnId}}",
  "newPosition": 0
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5155/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### ===== ACTIVITIES =====

### Get activity feed for board (latest 50)
GET http://localhost:5155/api/boards/{{boardId}}/activities?limit=50
Accept: application/json

### ===== SIGNALR HUBS =====
### Connect via SignalR client:
### - Board Hub:    ws://localhost:5155/hubs/board
### - Task Hub:     ws://localhost:5155/hubs/task
### - Activity Hub: ws://localhost:5155/hubs/activity
### Call JoinBoard("boardId") after connecting to receive events
